    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Best Video Formats for Downloading</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        When you download a video, you often have a choice of formats. Picking the right one affects playback quality, file size, and compatibility with your device. This guide explains the most common video download formats and when to use each.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">MP4: the universal choice</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">MP4 is the most widely supported video format. It works on phones, tablets, computers, TVs, and game consoles. MP4 files use efficient compression, so they balance good quality with reasonable file size. For most users, MP4 is the best default.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Step-by-step guide</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Consider your playback device. Phones and TVs usually prefer MP4.</li><li>Think about file size. Lower resolution MP4 files take less storage.</li><li>For web uploads, MP4 or WEBM work best.</li><li>For editing, MOV or ProRes may be better if available.</li><li>For archiving, MKV can hold multiple audio and subtitle tracks.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Helpful tips</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>MP4 with H.264 codec plays almost everywhere.</li><li>WEBM is great for web pages but may not play on older TVs.</li><li>MKV is flexible but may not be supported by all devices.</li><li>MOV files from Apple devices are high quality but large.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Legal and safety reminder</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Only download content you created, own, or have explicit permission to use. Respect copyright, platform terms, and local laws. For more details, read our <a href="/content-policy" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Content Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
