        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">What is the most compatible video format?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">MP4 with H.264 is supported by almost every device.</p>
        </details>
        
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
